#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom feeds, or feed generators, are services that provide algorithms to users. This gives you lots of freedom: to choose your own timeline view, or to [create a embeddable feed for other users](https://graze.leaflet.pub/3m4yjmbnyec2c).\n"
msgstr "カスタムフィード（フィードジェネレーター）は、ユーザーにアルゴリズムを提供するサービスです。これにより、自分好みのタイムライン表示を選んだり、[他のユーザー向けに埋め込み可能なフィードを作成したり](https://graze.leaflet.pub/3m4yjmbnyec2c)といった高い自由度が得られます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this tutorial, you'll create a custom feed server by consuming posts from the [firehose](/guides/streaming-data), algorithmically sorting them, and [broadcasting them as an XRPC feed](/guides/feeds).\n"
msgstr "このチュートリアルでは、[firehose](/guides/streaming-data)から投稿を取り込み、アルゴリズムで並び替え、[XRPCフィードとして配信する](/guides/feeds)ことで、カスタムフィードサーバーを作成します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You should have installed:\n"
"- Node.js 18+\n"
"- Go 1.25+\n"
msgstr ""
"以下をインストールしておいてください。\n"
"- Node.js 18以上\n"
"- Go 1.25以上\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:22
#: src/guides/statusphere-tutorial/en.mdx:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "On platforms supported by [homebrew](https://brew.sh/), you can install them with:\n"
msgstr "[homebrew](https://brew.sh/)に対応したプラットフォームでは、次のコマンドでインストールできます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"brew install node go\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```bash\n"
"brew install node go\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "You'll also need to install [`tap`](/guides/the-at-stack#tap) to consume the firehose of posts from the network. \n"
msgstr "ネットワーク上の投稿をfirehoseで取り込むために、[`tap`](/guides/the-at-stack#tap)のインストールも必要です。 \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"go install github.com/bluesky-social/indigo/cmd/tap\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```bash\n"
"go install github.com/bluesky-social/indigo/cmd/tap\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:48
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"mkdir my-agent\n"
"cd my-agent\n"
"npm init -y\n"
"npm i -D typescript ts-node @types/node dotenv @atproto/lex @atproto/lex-server @atproto/tap\n"
"npx tsc --init --verbatimModuleSyntax false\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```bash\n"
"mkdir my-agent\n"
"cd my-agent\n"
"npm init -y\n"
"npm i -D typescript ts-node @types/node dotenv @atproto/lex @atproto/lex-server @atproto/tap\n"
"npx tsc --init --verbatimModuleSyntax false\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:50
#: src/guides/statusphere-tutorial/en.mdx:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "You'll begin by adding Lexicons to your project.\n"
msgstr "まず、プロジェクトにLexiconを追加します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "## Part 1: Lexicons and Tap\n"
msgstr "<Heading level={2} id=\"part-1-lexicons-and-tap\">パート1：LexionとTap</Heading>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Lexicons](/guides/lexicon) define Atproto records. A baseline feed generator requires the `app.bsky.feed.describeFeedGenerator` and `app.bsky.feed.getFeedSkeleton` Lexicons. You can use `lex` to download and build these Lexicons into your project:\n"
msgstr "[Lexicon](/guides/lexicon)はAtprotoのレコードを定義します。基本的なフィードジェネレーターには`app.bsky.feed.describeFeedGenerator`と`app.bsky.feed.getFeedSkeleton`のLexiconが必要です。`lex`を使えば、これらのLexiconをダウンロードしてプロジェクトに組み込めます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:58
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"lex install app.bsky.feed.describeFeedGenerator app.bsky.feed.getFeedSkeleton\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```bash\n"
"lex install app.bsky.feed.describeFeedGenerator app.bsky.feed.getFeedSkeleton\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "From here, you can run `lex build` to generate TypeScript types for all of your installed Lexicons:\n"
msgstr "ここから`lex build`を実行すると、インストール済みLexiconすべてに対してTypeScriptの型を生成できます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "The generated code will live in `src/lexicons`.\n"
msgstr "生成されたコードは`src/lexicons`に配置されます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "You'll also need to run `tap` in a separate terminal to index posts from the network. Start `tap` with:\n"
msgstr "ネットワーク上の投稿をインデックスするために、別ターミナルで`tap`を実行する必要があります。次のコマンドで開始します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:72
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"tap run --disable-acks=true\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```bash\n"
"tap run --disable-acks=true\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now you can start building your feed generator.\n"
msgstr "これでフィードジェネレーターの構築を始められます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:76
#, no-wrap
msgid "## Part 2: Feed Structure\n"
msgstr "<Heading level={2} id=\"part-2-feed-structure\">パート2：フィードの構成</Heading>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:85
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- A user requests a feed from the application backend (e.g. Bluesky)\n"
"- The application finds the DID doc of the requested feed to look up its hosting server\n"
"- The application sends a `getFeedSkeleton` request to the hosting server\n"
"- The feed's hosting server returns a list of post URLs\n"
"- The application hydrates the feed (user info, post contents, aggregates, etc.)\n"
"- The application returns the hydrated feed to the user\n"
msgstr ""
"- ユーザーがアプリケーションバックエンド（例：Bluesky）にフィードを要求する\n"
"- アプリケーションが要求されたフィードのDIDドキュメントを見つけ、ホスティングサーバーを特定する\n"
"- アプリケーションがホスティングサーバーへ`getFeedSkeleton`リクエストを送る\n"
"- フィードのホスティングサーバーが投稿URLの一覧を返す\n"
"- アプリケーションがフィードをハイドレート（ユーザー情報、投稿内容、集計情報などを付加）する\n"
"- アプリケーションがハイドレート済みフィードをユーザーに返す\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:87
#, no-wrap
msgid "You'll start by capturing some configuration from environment variables. Much of this is configuration for the published feed (`FEED_PUBLISHER_DID`, `FEED_NAME`) but some details configure how the feed will behave (`FEED_MAX_POSTS`, `SEARCH_TERMS`).\n"
msgstr "最初に、環境変数から設定を読み取ります。多くは公開するフィード用の設定（`FEED_PUBLISHER_DID`, `FEED_NAME`）ですが、フィードの挙動を決める設定（`FEED_MAX_POSTS`, `SEARCH_TERMS`）も含まれます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:89
#, no-wrap
msgid "For this example, you'll be creating our entire app in a single file at `src/index.ts`. Create that file now, and add these imports and config lines:\n"
msgstr "この例では、アプリ全体を`src/index.ts`という単一ファイルで作成します。このファイルを作成し、以下のimportと設定行を追加してください。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:96
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```ts\n"
"import { AtUriString, DidString, asDidString } from '@atproto/lex'\n"
"import { LexError, LexRouter, serviceAuth } from '@atproto/lex-server'\n"
"import { serve } from '@atproto/lex-server/nodejs'\n"
"import { Tap, SimpleIndexer } from '@atproto/tap'\n"
"import * as app from './lexicons/app.js'\n"
msgstr ""
"```ts\n"
"import { AtUriString, DidString, asDidString } from '@atproto/lex'\n"
"import { LexError, LexRouter, serviceAuth } from '@atproto/lex-server'\n"
"import { serve } from '@atproto/lex-server/nodejs'\n"
"import { Tap, SimpleIndexer } from '@atproto/tap'\n"
"import * as app from './lexicons/app.js'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:100
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"// =============================================================================\n"
"// Configuration\n"
"// =============================================================================\n"
msgstr ""
"// =============================================================================\n"
"// Configuration\n"
"// =============================================================================\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:111
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"interface FeedConfig {\n"
"    publisherDid: DidString\n"
"    feedName: string\n"
"    searchTerms: string[]\n"
"    maxPosts: number\n"
"    port: number\n"
"    tapUrl: string\n"
"    tapPassword: string\n"
"    initialRepos: string[]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"interface FeedConfig {\n"
"    publisherDid: DidString\n"
"    feedName: string\n"
"    searchTerms: string[]\n"
"    maxPosts: number\n"
"    port: number\n"
"    tapUrl: string\n"
"    tapPassword: string\n"
"    initialRepos: string[]\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:113
#, no-wrap
msgid "const DEFAULT_REPO = 'did:plc:ragtjsm2j2vknwkz3zp4oxrd' // pfrazee.com\n"
msgstr "const DEFAULT_REPO = 'did:plc:ragtjsm2j2vknwkz3zp4oxrd' // pfrazee.com\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:124
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"const config: FeedConfig = {\n"
"    publisherDid: asDidString(process.env.FEED_PUBLISHER_DID || 'did:example:alice'),\n"
"    feedName: process.env.FEED_NAME || 'whats-alf',\n"
"    searchTerms: (process.env.FEED_SEARCH_TERMS || 'alf').split(',').map(s => s.trim()),\n"
"    maxPosts: parseInt(process.env.FEED_MAX_POSTS || '1000', 10),\n"
"    port: parseInt(process.env.FEED_PORT || '3000', 10),\n"
"    tapUrl: process.env.TAP_URL || 'http://localhost:2480',\n"
"    tapPassword: process.env.TAP_PASSWORD || 'secret',\n"
"    initialRepos: (process.env.FEED_INITIAL_REPOS || DEFAULT_REPO).split(',').map(s => s.trim()),\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"const config: FeedConfig = {\n"
"    publisherDid: asDidString(process.env.FEED_PUBLISHER_DID || 'did:example:alice'),\n"
"    feedName: process.env.FEED_NAME || 'whats-alf',\n"
"    searchTerms: (process.env.FEED_SEARCH_TERMS || 'alf').split(',').map(s => s.trim()),\n"
"    maxPosts: parseInt(process.env.FEED_MAX_POSTS || '1000', 10),\n"
"    port: parseInt(process.env.FEED_PORT || '3000', 10),\n"
"    tapUrl: process.env.TAP_URL || 'http://localhost:2480',\n"
"    tapPassword: process.env.TAP_PASSWORD || 'secret',\n"
"    initialRepos: (process.env.FEED_INITIAL_REPOS || DEFAULT_REPO).split(',').map(s => s.trim()),\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:127
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"const FEED_URI: AtUriString = `at://${config.publisherDid}/app.bsky.feed.generator/${config.feedName}` as AtUriString\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"const FEED_URI: AtUriString = `at://${config.publisherDid}/app.bsky.feed.generator/${config.feedName}` as AtUriString\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:129
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are a few things to note here. You've supplied a `DEFAULT_REPO` to fetch with `tap`. In this case, you're following a single user, [`pfrazee.com`](https://bsky.app/profile/pfrazee.com). This will keep the tutorial example manageable.\n"
msgstr "いくつか注目すべき点があります。`tap`で取得する対象として`DEFAULT_REPO`を指定しています。この例では一人のユーザーとして[`pfrazee.com`](https://bsky.app/profile/pfrazee.com)を追跡します。これにより、チュートリアルの例を扱いやすくしています。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:131
#, no-wrap
msgid "You're sorting this feed by searching for posts that contain certain terms. You can configure these terms with the `FEED_SEARCH_TERMS` environment variable. In this case, you're searching for posts that mention \"alf\".\n"
msgstr "このフィードは、特定の語句を含む投稿を検索して並び替えます。語句は`FEED_SEARCH_TERMS`環境変数で設定できます。この例では\"alf\"に言及する投稿を検索します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:133
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, you'll set up the logic to consume posts from the firehose.\n"
msgstr "次に、firehoseから投稿を取り込むロジックを設定します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:135
#, no-wrap
msgid "## Part 3: Consuming the Firehose\n"
msgstr "<Heading level={2} id=\"part-3-consuming-the-firehose\">パート3：firehose取り込み</Heading>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:137
#, no-wrap
msgid "You'll store the posts you want to serve in an array.\n"
msgstr "配信対象の投稿は配列に保存します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:139
#, no-wrap
msgid "As `tap` discovers posts from the network, this feed server will search their text for our configured search terms. If it finds a match, it'll add the post to your array. Add the following contents to `src/index.ts`:\n"
msgstr "`tap`がネットワーク上の投稿を検出すると、このフィードサーバーは投稿テキストを設定した検索語で検索します。一致した場合は投稿を配列に追加します。以下の内容を`src/index.ts`に追加してください。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:144
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```ts\n"
"// =============================================================================\n"
"// Post Index\n"
"// =============================================================================\n"
msgstr ""
"```ts\n"
"// =============================================================================\n"
"// Post Index\n"
"// =============================================================================\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:149
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"interface IndexedPost {\n"
"    uri: AtUriString\n"
"    indexedAt: number\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"interface IndexedPost {\n"
"    uri: AtUriString\n"
"    indexedAt: number\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:151
#, no-wrap
msgid "const postIndex: IndexedPost[] = []\n"
msgstr "const postIndex: IndexedPost[] = []\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:155
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"// =============================================================================\n"
"// Tap Indexer\n"
"// =============================================================================\n"
msgstr ""
"// =============================================================================\n"
"// Tap Indexer\n"
"// =============================================================================\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:158
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"const tap = new Tap(config.tapUrl, { adminPassword: config.tapPassword })\n"
"const indexer = new SimpleIndexer()\n"
msgstr ""
"const tap = new Tap(config.tapUrl, { adminPassword: config.tapPassword })\n"
"const indexer = new SimpleIndexer()\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:163
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"const searchPattern = new RegExp(\n"
"    `\\\\b(${config.searchTerms.map(t => t.replace(/[.*+?^${}()|[\\]\\\\]/g, '\\\\$&')).join('|')})\\\\b`,\n"
"    'i'\n"
")\n"
msgstr ""
"const searchPattern = new RegExp(\n"
"    `\\\\b(${config.searchTerms.map(t => t.replace(/[.*+?^${}()|[\\]\\\\]/g, '\\\\$&')).join('|')})\\\\b`,\n"
"    'i'\n"
")\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:166
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"indexer.record(async (evt) => {\n"
"    if (evt.collection !== 'app.bsky.feed.post') return\n"
msgstr ""
"indexer.record(async (evt) => {\n"
"    if (evt.collection !== 'app.bsky.feed.post') return\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:168
#, no-wrap
msgid "    const uri = `at://${evt.did}/${evt.collection}/${evt.rkey}` as AtUriString\n"
msgstr "    const uri = `at://${evt.did}/${evt.collection}/${evt.rkey}` as AtUriString\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:177
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    if (evt.action === 'delete') {\n"
"        const idx = postIndex.findIndex(p => p.uri === uri)\n"
"        if (idx !== -1) {\n"
"            postIndex.splice(idx, 1)\n"
"            console.log(`DELETE ${uri}`)\n"
"        }\n"
"        return\n"
"    }\n"
msgstr ""
"    if (evt.action === 'delete') {\n"
"        const idx = postIndex.findIndex(p => p.uri === uri)\n"
"        if (idx !== -1) {\n"
"            postIndex.splice(idx, 1)\n"
"            console.log(`DELETE ${uri}`)\n"
"        }\n"
"        return\n"
"    }\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:181
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    const text = (evt.record?.text as string) || ''\n"
"    if (!searchPattern.test(text)) return\n"
"    if (postIndex.some(p => p.uri === uri)) return\n"
msgstr ""
"    const text = (evt.record?.text as string) || ''\n"
"    if (!searchPattern.test(text)) return\n"
"    if (postIndex.some(p => p.uri === uri)) return\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:184
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    postIndex.unshift({ uri, indexedAt: Date.now() })\n"
"    if (postIndex.length > config.maxPosts) postIndex.pop()\n"
msgstr ""
"    postIndex.unshift({ uri, indexedAt: Date.now() })\n"
"    if (postIndex.length > config.maxPosts) postIndex.pop()\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:190
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    const preview = text.substring(0, 60).replace(/\\n/g, ' ')\n"
"    console.log(`${evt.action.toUpperCase()} ${uri}`)\n"
"    console.log(`  \"${preview}${text.length > 60 ? '...' : ''}\"`)\n"
"    console.log(`  ⭐ Added to index (${postIndex.length} total)`)\n"
"})\n"
msgstr ""
"    const preview = text.substring(0, 60).replace(/\\n/g, ' ')\n"
"    console.log(`${evt.action.toUpperCase()} ${uri}`)\n"
"    console.log(`  \"${preview}${text.length > 60 ? '...' : ''}\"`)\n"
"    console.log(`  ⭐ Added to index (${postIndex.length} total)`)\n"
"})\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:200
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"indexer.identity(async (evt) => {\n"
"    if (evt.status === 'active') return\n"
"    // Remove posts from disabled/deleted identities\n"
"    const removed = postIndex.filter(p => p.uri.includes(evt.did)).length\n"
"    if (removed > 0) {\n"
"        postIndex.splice(0, postIndex.length, ...postIndex.filter(p => !p.uri.includes(evt.did)))\n"
"        console.log(`Identity ${evt.did} (${evt.status}): removed ${removed} posts`)\n"
"    }\n"
"})\n"
msgstr ""
"indexer.identity(async (evt) => {\n"
"    if (evt.status === 'active') return\n"
"    // 削除/利用停止されたIDからの投稿を除去\n"
"    const removed = postIndex.filter(p => p.uri.includes(evt.did)).length\n"
"    if (removed > 0) {\n"
"        postIndex.splice(0, postIndex.length, ...postIndex.filter(p => !p.uri.includes(evt.did)))\n"
"        console.log(`Identity ${evt.did} (${evt.status}): removed ${removed} posts`)\n"
"    }\n"
"})\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:202
#, no-wrap
msgid "indexer.error((err) => console.error('Indexer error:', err))\n"
msgstr "indexer.error((err) => console.error('Indexer error:', err))\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:205
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"const channel = tap.channel(indexer)\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"const channel = tap.channel(indexer)\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:207
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here, you connect to `tap`, and use the `SimpleIndexer` function provided by the `@atproto/tap` library to process incoming records from the `app.bsky.feed.post` Lexicon — i.e., Bluesky posts.\n"
msgstr "ここでは`tap`に接続し、`@atproto/tap`ライブラリの`SimpleIndexer`関数を使って`app.bsky.feed.post` Lexicon、つまりBluesky投稿の受信レコードを処理しています。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:209
#, no-wrap
msgid "When a new post is discovered, you check if its text matches your search terms. If it does, you add it to your `postIndex` array. You'll also handle deletions and identity status changes to keep your index accurate.\n"
msgstr "新しい投稿が見つかったら、テキストが検索語に一致するか確認します。一致した場合は`postIndex`配列に追加します。さらに削除とIDステータス変更イベントも処理し、インデックスの正確性を保ちます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:211
#, no-wrap
msgid "Essentially, you're building an in-memory search index of posts that match your criteria. You'll then serve this index as a feed.\n"
msgstr "要するに、条件に一致する投稿のインメモリ検索インデックスを構築し、それをフィードとして配信します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:213
#, no-wrap
msgid "## Part 4: Serving the Feed\n"
msgstr "<Heading level={2} id=\"part-4-serving-the-feed\">パート4：フィード配信</Heading>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:215
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now, you'll add [XRPC](/guides/lexicon#http-api-methods) routes to serve our feed. Your server will be handling two kinds of requests:\n"
msgstr "次に、フィードを配信するための[XRPC](/guides/lexicon#http-api-methods)ルートを追加します。サーバーは次の2種類のリクエストを扱います。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:220
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```\n"
"GET /xrpc/app.bsky.feed.describeFeedGenerator\n"
"GET /xrpc/app.bsky.feed.getFeedSkeleton\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"GET /xrpc/app.bsky.feed.describeFeedGenerator\n"
"GET /xrpc/app.bsky.feed.getFeedSkeleton\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:222
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add the Feed Generator server logic to `src/index.ts`:\n"
msgstr "`src/index.ts`にフィードジェネレーターサーバーのロジックを追加します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:227
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```ts\n"
"// =============================================================================\n"
"// Feed Generator Server\n"
"// =============================================================================\n"
msgstr ""
"```ts\n"
"// =============================================================================\n"
"// Feed Generator Server\n"
"// =============================================================================\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:234
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"// Auth is optional for this demo since we only log the requester's DID.\n"
"// In production, you may want to use credentials to personalize the feed.\n"
"const auth = serviceAuth({\n"
"    audience: config.publisherDid,\n"
"    unique: async () => true,\n"
"})\n"
msgstr ""
"// このデモでは取得者のDIDを記録するだけなので認証は任意です。\n"
"// 本番環境ではフィードのパーソナライズ用途で認証情報を使うこともできます。\n"
"const auth = serviceAuth({\n"
"    audience: config.publisherDid,\n"
"    unique: async () => true,\n"
"})\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:236
#, no-wrap
msgid "const router = new LexRouter()\n"
msgstr "const router = new LexRouter()\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:253
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"router.add(app.bsky.feed.describeFeedGenerator, {\n"
"    auth,\n"
"    handler: (ctx) => {\n"
"        console.log('describeFeedGenerator from', ctx.credentials?.did)\n"
"        return {\n"
"            body: {\n"
"                did: config.publisherDid,\n"
"                feeds: [app.bsky.feed.describeFeedGenerator.feed.$build({ uri: FEED_URI })],\n"
"                links: {\n"
"                    privacyPolicy: 'https://example.com/privacy',\n"
"                    termsOfService: 'https://example.com/tos',\n"
"                },\n"
"            },\n"
"        }\n"
"    },\n"
"})\n"
msgstr ""
"router.add(app.bsky.feed.describeFeedGenerator, {\n"
"    auth,\n"
"    handler: (ctx) => {\n"
"        console.log('describeFeedGenerator from', ctx.credentials?.did)\n"
"        return {\n"
"            body: {\n"
"                did: config.publisherDid,\n"
"                feeds: [app.bsky.feed.describeFeedGenerator.feed.$build({ uri: FEED_URI })],\n"
"                links: {\n"
"                    privacyPolicy: 'https://example.com/privacy',\n"
"                    termsOfService: 'https://example.com/tos',\n"
"                },\n"
"            },\n"
"        }\n"
"    },\n"
"})\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:261
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"router.add(app.bsky.feed.getFeedSkeleton, {\n"
"    auth,\n"
"    handler: (ctx) => {\n"
"        if (ctx.params.feed !== FEED_URI) {\n"
"            throw new LexError('InvalidRequest', 'Feed not found')\n"
"        }\n"
"        console.log('getFeedSkeleton from', ctx.credentials?.did)\n"
msgstr ""
"router.add(app.bsky.feed.getFeedSkeleton, {\n"
"    auth,\n"
"    handler: (ctx) => {\n"
"        if (ctx.params.feed !== FEED_URI) {\n"
"            throw new LexError('InvalidRequest', 'Feed not found')\n"
"        }\n"
"        console.log('getFeedSkeleton from', ctx.credentials?.did)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:264
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        const limit = Math.min(ctx.params.limit ?? 50, 100)\n"
"        const cursor = ctx.params.cursor as string | undefined\n"
msgstr ""
"        const limit = Math.min(ctx.params.limit ?? 50, 100)\n"
"        const cursor = ctx.params.cursor as string | undefined\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:271
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        let startIdx = 0\n"
"        if (cursor) {\n"
"            const cursorTime = parseInt(cursor, 10)\n"
"            startIdx = postIndex.findIndex(p => p.indexedAt < cursorTime)\n"
"            if (startIdx === -1) startIdx = postIndex.length\n"
"        }\n"
msgstr ""
"        let startIdx = 0\n"
"        if (cursor) {\n"
"            const cursorTime = parseInt(cursor, 10)\n"
"            startIdx = postIndex.findIndex(p => p.indexedAt < cursorTime)\n"
"            if (startIdx === -1) startIdx = postIndex.length\n"
"        }\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:278
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        const slice = postIndex.slice(startIdx, startIdx + limit)\n"
"        const feed = slice.map(p => app.bsky.feed.defs.skeletonFeedPost.$build({ post: p.uri }))\n"
"        const lastPost = slice.at(-1)\n"
"        const nextCursor = lastPost && slice.length === limit && startIdx + limit < postIndex.length\n"
"            ? lastPost.indexedAt.toString()\n"
"            : undefined\n"
msgstr ""
"        const slice = postIndex.slice(startIdx, startIdx + limit)\n"
"        const feed = slice.map(p => app.bsky.feed.defs.skeletonFeedPost.$build({ post: p.uri }))\n"
"        const lastPost = slice.at(-1)\n"
"        const nextCursor = lastPost && slice.length === limit && startIdx + limit < postIndex.length\n"
"            ? lastPost.indexedAt.toString()\n"
"            : undefined\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:283
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        return { body: { feed, cursor: nextCursor } }\n"
"    },\n"
"})\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"        return { body: { feed, cursor: nextCursor } }\n"
"    },\n"
"})\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:285
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here, you're using `LexRouter` from the `@atproto/lex-server` package to define your XRPC routes. You'll notice that the `getFeedSkeleton` method returns a `cursor` in its response and takes a `cursor` param as input. This allows clients to paginate through your feed.\n"
msgstr "ここでは`@atproto/lex-server`パッケージの`LexRouter`を使ってXRPCルートを定義しています。`getFeedSkeleton`メソッドはレスポンスで`cursor`を返し、入力としても`cursor`パラメータを受け取ります。これによりクライアントはフィードをページネーションできます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:290
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Note>\n"
"This cursor is treated as an opaque value and fully at the Feed Generator's discretion. It is passed through the AppView directly to and from the client. The cursor be _unique per feed item_ to prevent unexpected behavior in pagination. For instance, a compound cursor with a timestamp + a CID:\n"
"`1683654690921::bafyreia3tbsfxe3cc75xrxyyn6qc42oupi73fxiox76prlyi5bpx7hr72u`\n"
"</Note>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Note>\n"
"このカーソルは不透明な値として扱われ、実装はフィードジェネレーター側に完全に委ねられます。AppViewはこの値をクライアントとの間でそのまま中継します。ページネーション時の予期しない挙動を防ぐため、カーソルは*各フィード項目に対して一意*である必要があります。例えば、次のようなタイムスタンプとCIDを組み合わせたカーソルです。\n"
"`1683654690921::bafyreia3tbsfxe3cc75xrxyyn6qc42oupi73fxiox76prlyi5bpx7hr72u`\n"
"</Note>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/custom-feed-tutorial/en.mdx:292
